Version: 2.0.2
	Changed addon icon
	Added icon to the stack and size tabs
	Added player-specific trade overrides that can save custom stack counts and stack sizes per player
	Added a Save button to the trade window for storing the current trade setup as a player override
	Added a Player Overrides settings page to view, edit, and delete saved player overrides
	Added "Trade anyway" support for player override items that are not currently selected in Trade Settings
	Improved automatic trade filling with a queued retry flow for more reliable stack placement
	Updated trade setup navigation, localization, saved data defaults, and TOC file lists for player overrides

Version: 2.0.1
	Fixed minimap button text so the tooltip and click instructions display correctly
	Updated the UI folder structure for clearer organization around settings sections
	Reorganized settings files into General, Trading Rules, Trading Setup, Trade Log, and Shared UI folders
	Fixxed color "Not trade below"

Version: 2.0.0
	Complete addon rewrite with a modern modular structure for better maintainability
	Added custom stack count and stack size options for:
		"Ungrouped"
		"Party Members"
		"Raid Members"
	Added "Bag Opener", allowing bags to open while trading and close automatically when finished
	Added a "Trading Status Panel" that shows all messages related to trading in the trade window
	Added option to hide "Trading Status Panel"
	"Loot Master" now works as intended
	Removed messages from "Split and restack"
	Updated slashcommands:
		/tf
		/tf on
		/tf off
		/tf limit

